---
title: "Alma Analytics Catalog File Parser"
output: html_document
params:
  catalog_file: "data/Annual Stats FY 2025-2026.catalog"
  output_dir: "output"
---

## Run the pipeline

This report uses a parameter instead of an interactive file picker, so it can be
rendered reproducibly from RStudio or the command line.

```{r setup}
source("scripts/run_pipeline.R")
catalog <- run_pipeline(params$catalog_file, params$output_dir)
```

## Catalog summary

```{r catalog-summary}
catalog[c(
  "catalog_index", "object_title", "object_kind", "xml_root_name",
  "subject_area", "original_path"
)]
```

## Object counts

```{r object-counts}
as.data.frame(table(catalog$object_kind), stringsAsFactors = FALSE)
```

## Generated files

```{r generated-files}
data.frame(file = list.files(params$output_dir, full.names = TRUE))
```
